## API REST

### Health Check

```http
GET /
```

Respuesta:

```json
{
  "status": "running",
  "model": "Logistic Regression",
  "f1_score": 0.9847
}
```

---

### Predicción

```http
POST /predict
```

Request:

```json
{
  "text": "How can I open an investment account?"
}
```

Response:

```json
{
  "query": "How can I open an investment account?",
  "intent": "create_account",
  "confidence": 0.98
}
```

